  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective waste management in Bantala Leather Cluster through circular and sustainable practises</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project addresses social and environmental risks associated with the leather industries in Kolkata, which are endangering the economic and social development of the region in the long term.The project will specifically aim at improving social and environmental impact of companies&apos; businesses by addressing the related risks through the following measures:&#x2022;	Responsible and sustainable practices in solid waste recycle, management and pollution reduction.&#x2022;	Making production processes transparent and sustainable by adoption of green and cleaner technologies.&#x2022;	Reducing health and safety risks by addressing Occupational Health and Safety in tanneries and leather units.</narrative>
  </description>
